          <mxGeometry x="3450" y="4110" width="200" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ixe7MUHFaq18b2KZA4J4-1080" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;1. Сервис аутентификации - отвечает за аутентификацию пользователя и валидацию JWT токена. Его использует API Gateway чтобы проверить, что у пользователя есть доступ к сервису.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;2. Сервис пользователей - отвечает за регистрацию новых пользователей, редактирование профиля. Сервис отправляет почтовое уведомление в Сервис нотификации при регистрации пользователя.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;3. Сервис товаров - каталог товаров, заведение новых позиции и редактирование.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;4. Сервис заказов - создание заказов товаров, проведение по статусам и отправка на платеж. Отправляет уведомление в Сервис нотификации.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;5. Сервис платежей - здесь проводятся все операции с платежем, обработка транзакции, работа с внешним апи платежной системы.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;6. Сервис аукционов - создание и участие в аукционах.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Отправляет уведомление в Сервис нотификации.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;7. Сервис услуг - создание и выполнение услуг.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;8. Сервис заявок - создание заявок в техподдержку и на аппеляцию. Сервис используют тех. поддержка в отдельном клиенте.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;9. Сервис нотификации - получение и отправка нотификации на клиент/почту. Использует для работы брокер сообщений RabbitMQ.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;10. Сервис отчетов - генерация отчетов на основе данных в сервисе. Использует в качестве бд Clickhouse. В CH данные должны попадать из бд микросервисов используя ETL инструменты.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;Центральной точкой в архитектуре будет являться API&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Gateway. Это еще один сервис, который будет в себе заниматься роутингом запросов от клиента к нужным микросервисам и собирать данные из микросервисов в один ответ клиенту. Перед запросам в сервисы, Gateway валидирует токен в сервисе аутентификации.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3420" y="4140" width="710" height="450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
